{
  "version": 1,
  "params": {
    "gallery": {
      "label": "Gallery page",
      "type": "lookup",
      "source": "commons-gallery",
      "options": [
        "The Venetian Macao",
        "London",
        "New York City"
      ],
      "value": "The Venetian Macao"
    }
  },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "gal-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "## 🎞️ A Commons gallery, as data\n\nA gallery page is a **main-namespace page containing a `<gallery>` tag** — no prefix, no namespace (`Gallery:` is not an alias; that title is simply missing). What makes one a gallery is content: 87,315 pages carry `{{Gallery page}}`.\n\nUnlike a category, a gallery has **hand-written captions in a hand-chosen order**. This board reads those captions and hands them to other cards — the ⬇ translator reads the *first caption*, and clicking any tile publishes that file for the 📄 reader beside it.",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gal-pick",
      "widgetType": "boardControls",
      "config": {
        "title": "Pick a gallery",
        "show": "gallery",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gal",
      "widgetType": "commonsGallery",
      "config": {
        "page": "{{gallery}}",
        "project": "commons.wikimedia",
        "displayMode": "grid",
        "iconSize": "medium",
        "imageFit": "cover",
        "maxItems": 24,
        "groupBy": "none",
        "linkAction": "send to the board",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gal-page",
      "widgetType": "wikiPage",
      "config": {
        "page": "{{widget:gal#selection}}",
        "project": "commons.wikimedia",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gal-caption",
      "widgetType": "translate",
      "config": {
        "text": "{{widget:gal}}",
        "from": "en",
        "to": "de",
        "display": "translation",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "gal-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "gal-pick",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "gal",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 4,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "gal-page",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "gal-caption",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}
